  "createdAt": "2026-09-08T17:30:06.220687Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-21T00:35:09.659335Z",
  "totalBlocks": 30,
  "translatedBlocks": 27,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63307667b1864134",
      "translationZh": "我们开发 PipesHub 已经有一段时间了，我很希望能有更多团队来试用，并告诉我们它在哪些地方会出问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9a18ce8c0140c6d",
      "translationZh": "我们反复遇到的问题其实很简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34ad74158f01e3a1",
      "translationZh": "基于公司数据构建 AI 应用，在演示里看起来很容易。连接几个数据源，把文档分块，扔进向量数据库，或者连接几个 mcps，再加上一个 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e26908b08a70326",
      "translationZh": "然后，你开始尝试让它真正有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb415219e3ecc74d",
      "translationZh": "你的数据分散在 S3、Google Drive、Slack、Jira、Confluence、SharePoint、电子邮件、数据库等地方。权限需要保留。文档会发生变化。同一个文件会出现在多个地方。引用需要指向实际来源。而且，你最终会希望智能体和其他应用都能使用这些上下文，而不必每次都重新构建同一套集成层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a0fdaedbd015379",
      "translationZh": "这正是我们试图通过 PipesHub 解决的问题，同时为开放模型提供一流支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d52d968cb2e3308",
      "translationZh": "它是一个采用 Apache 2.0 许可证的开源上下文层，连接到你的公司数据，并让搜索、聊天、智能体、MCP 客户端或你自己的应用能够使用这些上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1a4c9f911b8e15c",
      "translationZh": "我们关注的几个方面：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a4be72d79a25d9b",
      "translationZh": "在你自己的基础设施上自行托管",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ebbff59d4fb7d89",
      "translationZh": "保留源数据的访问权限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77a8281c30fd8c16",
      "translationZh": "获取可追溯到原始文档的引用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "206c14dc04118ccd",
      "translationZh": "结合知识图谱与语义检索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6d4f73346ed4d90",
      "translationZh": "使用你自己的 LLM 和嵌入模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19b478a3fefe1677",
      "translationZh": "通过 Python、TypeScript、Go 或 MCP 使用它",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e322895da4565a5",
      "translationZh": "避免被锁定在单一数据库或基础设施技术栈中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c28762ebecd52557",
      "translationZh": "为开放模型提供一等支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1f095556b20aacf",
      "translationZh": "我们还特意让核心基础设施保持可插拔：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "caa8f4f572337fb8",
      "translationZh": "本地文件系统、S3、Azure Blob",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03148a0d6f6953d8",
      "translationZh": "由你选择 LLM 和嵌入模型提供商，包括本地模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2e92c1594a605d9",
      "translationZh": "如果你已经在运行 Qdrant 和 redis，可以继续使用它们。比起 ArangoDB，你更喜欢 Neo4j？完全没问题。想在本地运行模型？也可以。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "530cf9e5b238e935",
      "translationZh": "我们的目标是为你提供一个统一的上下文层，而不是强迫你采用我们的整套技术栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "057c28be012cba72",
      "translationZh": "在构建这一系统的过程中，我们不得不解决一系列问题，而这些问题只有在超越简单智能体之后才会显现出来：检索时考虑访问权限、在整个处理流水线中保持引用准确、对不同来源中的相同内容去重、高效地为已变更的文档重新建立索引、让索引构建在差异很大的工作负载下都能良好运作，等等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b623494233046fda",
      "translationZh": "我们最终采用的一些解决方案相当不走寻常路，我很乐意进一步撰文介绍它们，或与任何正在开发类似系统的人讨论其中的权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0146e875ff28a55c",
      "translationZh": "我们还有很多想要改进的地方，这也是我发这篇帖子的原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de9b3aed5de8d41d",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在构建内部 AI 工具、企业搜索、RAG、工作流自动化，或需要访问公司知识的智能体，我会非常感谢你试用一下 PipesHub。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3de04b98b84e6cdb",
      "translationZh": "如果你试用后觉得有什么地方过于复杂、缓慢、无法正常运行，或者就是设计得不好，请告诉我们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45c48d74813b8d9a",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Effective-Ad2060 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
